Description: Make the build configurable instead of hardcoded
 Lets CC, CFLAGS, LDFLAGS, BLAS_LIBS, OpenMP flags, prefix and DESTDIR be
 set from the make command line, drops -march=native, -Ofast and -static,
 pins -std=gnu99, installs the library, headers and a pkg-config file, and
 optionally (SHARED=yes) builds a shared library.
Forwarded: https://github.com/coin-or/Csdp/pull/22

